{"unit_id":"biotechdrli-byte__dsh-desktop-transparency#feature-1","repo":"biotechdrli-byte/dsh-desktop-transparency","commit":"d4c3a1ec2ea1b8799dbecf4f5aafa5a952bcbf04","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-transparency 的功能「屏幕对齐壁纸」：读取 Windows 当前桌面壁纸并铺在界面底层。壁纸按屏幕尺寸和窗口坐标定位，窗口移动或缩放时仍与桌面图像衔接。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:65-71","lib/client.js:260-273"]}
{"unit_id":"biotechdrli-byte__dsh-desktop-transparency#feature-2","repo":"biotechdrli-byte/dsh-desktop-transparency","commit":"d4c3a1ec2ea1b8799dbecf4f5aafa5a952bcbf04","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-transparency 的功能「分区透明度面板」：打开右下角控制面板，分别调节侧栏、对话区、顶栏、右侧栏和浮层的不透明度。滑块修改即时应用并保存设置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:58-84","lib/client.js:534-545"]}
{"unit_id":"biotechdrli-byte__dsh-desktop-transparency#feature-3","repo":"biotechdrli-byte/dsh-desktop-transparency","commit":"d4c3a1ec2ea1b8799dbecf4f5aafa5a952bcbf04","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-transparency 的功能「背景外观调节」：在控制面板拖动模糊和压暗滑块，调整壁纸背景的柔化程度与亮度；修改会立即反映在背景层。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:260-273","lib/client.js:551-560"]}
{"unit_id":"biotechdrli-byte__dsh-desktop-transparency#feature-4","repo":"biotechdrli-byte/dsh-desktop-transparency","commit":"d4c3a1ec2ea1b8799dbecf4f5aafa5a952bcbf04","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-transparency 的功能「对齐校准与快捷键」：面板可调 X、Y 偏移，也可用 Ctrl+Alt 加方向键微调；Ctrl+Alt+H 切换面板，设置会保存以便下次使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:566-586","lib/client.js:701-735"]}
{"unit_id":"biotechdrli-byte__dsh-desktop-transparency#caveat-1","repo":"biotechdrli-byte/dsh-desktop-transparency","commit":"d4c3a1ec2ea1b8799dbecf4f5aafa5a952bcbf04","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-transparency 仅适用于 Windows；分区定位使用桌面界面的类名选择器，DSH 升级后可能需要重新校准选择器。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:36-56","lib/client.js:58-84"]}
